# Shared install-render defaults — ONE source of truth for both render paths:
#   - fleet-pxe register   (dev box; also mints a 7-day R2 cred)
#   - the tower's interactive PXE menu  (server.py -> render_install.py, NO cred)
# deploy.sh copies this to the tower so the menu renders identical configs.
#
# Nothing here is a secret beyond what the tower already stores: PW_HASH is a hash and
# already appears in every rendered user-data under state/registry/, which additionally
# holds real R2 credentials. The pubkey is public by definition.
